# <custom_item>
#   type        : AUDIT_ESX
#   description : "1.0018 - VMWARE - ESXI-67-000036 - The ESXi host must disable ESXi Shell unless needed for diagnostics or troubleshooting."
#   info        : "The ESXi Shell is an interactive command line environment available locally from the DCUI or remotely via SSH."
