# <custom_item>
#   type        : AUDIT_ESX
#   description : "1.0031 - VMWARE - ESXI-67-000035 - The ESXi host must be configured to disable nonessential capabilities by disabling SSH."
#   info        : "The ESXi Shell is an interactive command line interface (CLI) available at the ESXi server console."
