# <custom_item>
#   type        : AUDIT_ESX
#   description : "1.0056 - VMWARE - (L1) Ensure port groups are not configured to VLAN 4095 and 0 except for Virtual Guest Tagging (VGT)"
#   info        : "This recommendation is intended to address configuring pyrtgroups for a standard switch."
