#   description : "1.0070 - VMWARE - (L1) Ensure secure protocols are used for virtual serial port access"
#   info        : "Serial ports are interfaces for connecting peripherals to the VM."
#   solution    : "To configure all virtual serial ports to use secure protocols, change any protocols that are not secure to one of the following: - ssl - the equivalent of TCP+SSL - tcp+ssl - SSL over TCP over IPv4 or IPv6 - tcp4+ssl - SSL over TCP over IPv4 - tcp6+ssl - SSL over TCP over IPv6 - telnets - telnet over SSL over TCP"
#   reference   : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-7 MA-4"
